flowchart LR
    A[Skill catalog] --> B[Name and description]
    B --> C{Task matches?}
    C -->|No| D[Proceed without skill]
    C -->|Yes| E[Load SKILL.md]
    E --> F[Read references or assets if needed]
    E --> G[Run scripts if needed]
    F --> H[Produce output]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Check quality gates]
    I -->|Pass| J[Return result]
    I -->|Fail| K[Revise or escalate]
    K --> I
